OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 7 MAY
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,7,     Gfavourites from composers such as
OL,8,     GMendelssohn, Scarlatti and Mel
OL,9,     GBonis.
OL,10,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,11,     GSir Mark Elder is reunited with
OL,12,     Gthe Halle Orchestra and Choir in
OL,13,     Ga programme of music by Glinka,
OL,14,     GRachmaninov, Stravinsky, and
OL,15,     GTchaikovsky.
OL,16,G2145FThe Essay: The Insect Singers
OL,17,     GThe Essay celebrates the
OL,18,     Gmusicality of Earth's insect
OL,19,     Gsingers. Autumn Cricket Song. A
OL,20,     Gbeautiful song of stridulation
OL,21,     Gthat begins in summer and edges
OL,22,     Ginto the melancholy of autumn.
